{"s":49,"v":[{"t":"O you who have believed, do not put [yourselves] before Allāh and His Messenger but fear Allāh. Indeed, Allāh is Hearing and Knowing.","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O you who believe","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","O you who believe","alladhīna",""],["ءَامَنُوا۟","O you who believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["لَا","(Do) not","lā",""],["تُقَدِّمُوا۟","put (yourselves) forward ","tuqaddimū","",[["تُقَدِّمُ",409],["وا۟",4]]],["بَيْنَ","before Allah","bayna",""],["يَدَىِ","before Allah","yadayi",""],["ٱللَّهِ","before Allah","l-lahi",""],["وَرَسُولِهِۦ","and His Messenger","warasūlihi","ۖ",[["وَ",1],["رَسُولِ",47],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَٱتَّقُوا۟","and fear Allah","wa-ittaqū","",[["وَ",1],["ٱتَّقُ",83],["وا۟",4]]],["ٱللَّهَ","and fear Allah","l-laha","ۚ"],["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["سَمِيعٌ","(is) All-Hearer","samīʿun",""],["عَلِيمٌۭ","All-Knower","ʿalīmun",""]]},{"t":"O you who have believed, do not raise your voices above the voice of the Prophet or be loud to him in speech like the loudness of some of you to others, lest your deeds become worthless while you perceive not.","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O you who believe","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","O you who believe","alladhīna",""],["ءَامَنُوا۟","O you who believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["لَا","(Do) not","lā",""],["تَرْفَعُوٓا۟","raise","tarfaʿū","",[["تَرْفَعُ",472],["وٓا۟",4]]],["أَصْوَٰتَكُمْ","your voices","aṣwātakum","",[["أَصْوَٰتَ",980],["كُمْ",4]]],["فَوْقَ","above","fawqa",""],["صَوْتِ","(the) voice","ṣawti",""],["ٱلنَّبِىِّ","(of) the Prophet","l-nabiyi","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّبِىِّ",169]]],["وَلَا","and (do) not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["تَجْهَرُوا۟","be loud","tajharū","",[["تَجْهَرُ",1306],["وا۟",4]]],["لَهُۥ","to him","lahu","",[["لَ",8],["هُۥ",5]]],["بِٱلْقَوْلِ","in speech","bil-qawli","",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["قَوْلِ",137]]],["كَجَهْرِ","like (the) loudness","kajahri","",[["كَ",54],["جَهْرِ",1052]]],["بَعْضِكُمْ","(of) some of you","baʿḍikum","",[["بَعْضِ",86],["كُمْ",4]]],["لِبَعْضٍ","to others","libaʿḍin","",[["لِ",8],["بَعْضٍ",86]]],["أَن","lest","an",""],["تَحْبَطَ","become worthless","taḥbaṭa",""],["أَعْمَـٰلُكُمْ","your deeds","aʿmālukum","",[["أَعْمَـٰلُ",183],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَأَنتُمْ","while you","wa-antum","",[["وَ",1],["أَنتُمْ",4]]],["لَا","(do) not","lā",""],["تَشْعُرُونَ","perceive","tashʿurūna","",[["تَشْعُرُ",438],["ونَ",4]]]]},{"t":"Indeed, those who lower their voices before the Messenger of Allāh - they are the ones whose hearts Allāh has tested for righteousness. For them is forgiveness and great reward.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["يَغُضُّونَ","lower","yaghuḍḍūna","",[["يَغُضُّ",1679],["ونَ",3]]],["أَصْوَٰتَهُمْ","their voices","aṣwātahum","",[["أَصْوَٰتَ",980],["هُمْ",3]]],["عِندَ","(in) presence","ʿinda",""],["رَسُولِ","(of the) Messenger of Allah ","rasūli",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of the) Messenger of Allah ","l-lahi",""],["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","those","ulāika","",[["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِ",72],["كَ",0]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(are) the ones","alladhīna",""],["ٱمْتَحَنَ","Allah has tested","im'taḥana",""],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah has tested","l-lahu",""],["قُلُوبَهُمْ","their hearts","qulūbahum","",[["قُلُوبَ",104],["هُمْ",3]]],["لِلتَّقْوَىٰ","for righteousness","lilttaqwā","ۚ",[["لِ",8],["ل",2],["تَّقْوَىٰ",567]]],["لَهُم","For them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُم",3]]],["مَّغْفِرَةٌۭ","(is) forgiveness","maghfiratun",""],["وَأَجْرٌ","and a reward","wa-ajrun","",[["وَ",1],["أَجْرٌ",128]]],["عَظِيمٌ","great","ʿaẓīmun",""]]},{"t":"Indeed, those who call you, [O Muḥammad], from behind the chambers - most of them do not use reason.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["يُنَادُونَكَ","call you","yunādūnaka","",[["يُنَادُ",278],["ونَ",3],["كَ",18]]],["مِن","from","min",""],["وَرَآءِ","behind","warāi",""],["ٱلْحُجُرَٰتِ","the private chambers","l-ḥujurāti","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حُجُرَٰتِ",3403]]],["أَكْثَرُهُمْ","most of them","aktharuhum","",[["أَكْثَرُ",156],["هُمْ",3]]],["لَا","(do) not","lā",""],["يَعْقِلُونَ","understand","yaʿqilūna","",[["يَعْقِلُ",250],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"And if they had been patient until you [could] come out to them, it would have been better for them. But Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful.","w":[["وَلَوْ","And if","walaw","",[["وَ",1],["لَوْ",73]]],["أَنَّهُمْ","they","annahum","",[["أَنَّ",41],["هُمْ",3]]],["صَبَرُوا۟","had been patient","ṣabarū","",[["صَبَرُ",212],["وا۟",3]]],["حَتَّىٰ","until","ḥattā",""],["تَخْرُجَ","you came out","takhruja",""],["إِلَيْهِمْ","to them","ilayhim","",[["إِلَيْ",26],["هِمْ",3]]],["لَكَانَ","certainly it would be","lakāna","",[["لَ",23],["كَانَ",21]]],["خَيْرًۭا","better","khayran",""],["لَّهُمْ","for them","lahum","ۚ",[["لَّ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["وَٱللَّهُ","And Allah","wal-lahu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱللَّهُ",9]]],["غَفُورٌۭ","(is) Oft-Forgiving","ghafūrun",""],["رَّحِيمٌۭ","Most Merciful","raḥīmun",""]]},{"t":"O you who have believed, if there comes to you a disobedient one with information, investigate, lest you harm a people out of ignorance and become, over what you have done, regretful.","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O you who believe","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","O you who believe","alladhīna",""],["ءَامَنُوٓا۟","O you who believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وٓا۟",3]]],["إِن","If","in",""],["جَآءَكُمْ","comes to you","jāakum","",[["جَآءَ",57],["كُمْ",4]]],["فَاسِقٌۢ","a wicked person","fāsiqun",""],["بِنَبَإٍۢ","with information","binaba-in","",[["بِ",10],["نَبَإٍۢ",390]]],["فَتَبَيَّنُوٓا۟","investigate","fatabayyanū","",[["فَ",7],["تَبَيَّنُ",540],["وٓا۟",4]]],["أَن","lest","an",""],["تُصِيبُوا۟","you harm","tuṣībū","",[["تُصِيبُ",195],["وا۟",4]]],["قَوْمًۢا","a people","qawman",""],["بِجَهَـٰلَةٍۢ","in ignorance","bijahālatin","",[["بِ",10],["جَهَـٰلَةٍۢ",1507]]],["فَتُصْبِحُوا۟","then you become","fatuṣ'biḥū","",[["فَ",7],["تُص